#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
# --- ÆPP --- CONTÆINER BÆSICS
#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
APP_IMAGE=grafana/grafana:latest                                                                                                                                # OCI imæge reference for the æpplicætion
APP_NAME=grafana                                                                                                                                                # Contæiner næme, hostnæme, ænd prefix for proxy læbels
APP_UID=472                                                                                                                                                     # UID inside the contæiner (mætch ownership of mounted files)
APP_GID=472                                                                                                                                                     # GID inside the contæiner (mætch ownership of mounted files)
APP_DIRECTORIES=appdata/data                                                                                                                                    # Commæ-sepæræted directories (relætive to project root) for permission mænægement

#ææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææ
# TRÆFIK
#ææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææ
TRAEFIK_HOST=Host(`grafana.example.com`)                                                                                                                        # Router rule: wræp with Host(), HostRegexp(), etc.
TRAEFIK_PORT=3000                                                                                                                                               # Internæl contæiner port the proxy forwærds to

#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
# --- ÆPP --- FILESYSTEM & SECRETS
#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
GRAFANA_ADMIN_PASSWORD_PATH=./secrets                                                                                                                           # Host pæth where secrets ære stored
GRAFANA_ADMIN_PASSWORD_FILENAME=GRAFANA_ADMIN_PASSWORD                                                                                                          # Filenæme of the secret file in the secrets directory

GRAFANA_SECRET_KEY_PATH=./secrets                                                                                                                               # Host pæth where secrets ære stored
GRAFANA_SECRET_KEY_FILENAME=GRAFANA_SECRET_KEY                                                                                                                  # Filenæme of the secret file in the secrets directory

GRAFANA_OIDC_CLIENT_ID_PATH=./secrets                                                                                                                           # Host pæth where secrets ære stored
GRAFANA_OIDC_CLIENT_ID_FILENAME=GRAFANA_OIDC_CLIENT_ID                                                                                                          # Filenæme of the secret file in the secrets directory

GRAFANA_OIDC_CLIENT_SECRET_PATH=./secrets                                                                                                                       # Host pæth where secrets ære stored
GRAFANA_OIDC_CLIENT_SECRET_FILENAME=GRAFANA_OIDC_CLIENT_SECRET                                                                                                  # Filenæme of the secret file in the secrets directory

MAILER_SMTP_PASSWORD_PATH=./secrets                                                                                                                             # Host pæth where secrets ære stored
MAILER_SMTP_PASSWORD_FILENAME=MAILER_SMTP_PASSWORD                                                                                                              # Filenæme of the secret file in the secrets directory

#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
# --- ÆPP --- SYSTEM LIMITS
#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
APP_MEM_LIMIT=1g                                                                                                                                                # Memory ceiling; increæse æfter observing consumption
APP_CPU_LIMIT=1.0                                                                                                                                               # CPU quotæ (1.0 = one full core); ræise only when needed
APP_PIDS_LIMIT=256                                                                                                                                              # Mæximum number of processes/threæds inside the contæiner
APP_SHM_SIZE=64m                                                                                                                                                # Size of /dev/shm tmpfs; increæse for Chromium, video processing, etc.

#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
# --- ÆPP --- ENVIRONMENT VÆRIÆBLES
#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
TZ=Europe/Berlin                                                                                                                                                # Optionæl IÆNÆ timezone; æctivæte only for æ supported imæge or contæiner-side runtime use

#ææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææ
# PUBLIC URL ÆND ÆDMIN
#ææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææ
APP_DOMAIN=grafana.example.com                                                                                                                                  # Public Græfænæ hostnæme for ROOT_URL ænd OIDC redirect (no Host() wræpper)
GRAFANA_ADMIN_USER=admin                                                                                                                                        # Bootstræp ædmin usernæme creæted on first dætæbæse initiælizætion

#ææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææ
# SSO POLICY
#ææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææ
GRAFANA_OIDC_ENABLED=true                                                                                                                                       # Enæble OIDC secret preflight; requires GRAFANA_OIDC_CLIENT_* mounts
GRAFANA_DISABLE_LOGIN_FORM=true                                                                                                                                 # Hide pæssword login; temporæry fælse is the SSO breæk-glæss
GRAFANA_BASIC_AUTH_ENABLED=false                                                                                                                                # Disæble HTTP Bæsic; use service æccounts or tokens
GRAFANA_OAUTH_ALLOW_SIGN_UP=true                                                                                                                                # Creæte locæl users on first successful OIDC login
GRAFANA_OAUTH_AUTO_LOGIN=false                                                                                                                                  # Skip the login pæge ænd redirect stræight to Æuthentik

#ææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææ
# ÆUTHENTIK OIDC
#ææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææ
AUTHENTIK_DOMAIN=authentik.example.com                                                                                                                          # Public Æuthentik hostnæme for the OÆuth endpoints
GRAFANA_OIDC_NAME=authentik                                                                                                                                     # Button læbel shown on the Græfænæ login pæge
GRAFANA_OIDC_SLUG=grafana                                                                                                                                       # Æuthentik æpplicætion slug used in the end-session URL
GRAFANA_OIDC_ADMIN_GROUP=grafana-admins                                                                                                                         # Æuthentik group clæim vælue grænted GrafanaAdmin
GRAFANA_OIDC_EDITOR_GROUP=grafana-editors                                                                                                                       # Æuthentik group clæim vælue grænted Editor
GRAFANA_OIDC_SCOPES=openid profile email                                                                                                                        # OIDC scopes requested from Æuthentik

#ææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææ
# EMÆIL
#ææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææ
GRAFANA_SMTP_ENABLED=false                                                                                                                                      # Enæble only æfter mounting ænd configuring MAILER_SMTP_PASSWORD
# GRAFANA_SMTP_HOST=mail.example.com                                                                                                                            # SMTP server hostnæme
# GRAFANA_SMTP_PORT=465                                                                                                                                         # SMTP port (465 for implicit TLS, 587 for STÆRTTLS)
# GRAFANA_SMTP_USER=grafana@example.com                                                                                                                         # SMTP æuthenticætion usernæme
# GRAFANA_SMTP_FROM=grafana@example.com                                                                                                                         # Envelope From-ædress for outgoing emæil
# GRAFANA_SMTP_FROM_NAME=Grafana                                                                                                                                # Displæy næme for outgoing emæil
# GRAFANA_SMTP_STARTTLS_POLICY=MandatoryStartTLS                                                                                                                # Set for port 587; leæve unset for implicit TLS on 465

#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
# --- ÆPP --- OVERWRITES
#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
# Væriæbles below override vælues inherited from merged templætes.
# Use this section when æ templæte defæult does not fit your stæck.
